* Identify the required pins from the symbol definition.  
* Place the CH340C centrally and the power symbols left/right with clear spacing.  
* Add a single 100 nF capacitor below the chip to ground.  
* Connect VCC to VCC and V3 to the regulator input, then to the capacitor, and finally to GND.  
* Connect the 5 V rail to VCC.  
* Use straight wires; no extra labels are needed because the power symbols already provide net names.  

